Don't lit them when you don't use them.
You can use 'x' to swap them to secondary weapon *and* unlit them at the  
same time, then 'a'pply the saber to lit it *and* switch it to main weapon  
at the same time.

The problem is that all classes (iirc) are restricted in lightsaber so  
that will never become the best late weapon. And in the early game, using  
them will waste precious hits with other weapon skills that you might want  
to train.

Necromancers get Serpent's tongue as a first sacrifice gift. This is a  
more than decent mid game weapon. Plus it is a dagger and getting the  
dagger skill as high as possible asap is generally really really good (one  
of the best ranged weapon).

If you want to use lightsabe, I strongly recommend using blindcoder's jedi  
patch which allows you to play a jedi. They get a "charge lightsaber"  
technique at some point. And a infinite-supply lightsaber as quest  
artefact.

